# Hook and feature specs

Handbook: [conventions.md → Testing](../../docs/handbook/conventions.md#testing). Project skill: `.cursor/skills/hook-feature-specs/SKILL.md`.

- **TDD:** Failing spec before production code for new behavior.
- **Hook specs (`src/hooks/*.hook.spec.*`):** Exactly **one** top-level **`describe`** — no nesting.
- **Factories** for domain data; **`renderFeatureHook`** / **`TestProviders`** for hooks and UI.
- Mock **`src/api/urls`** only — never **`src/hooks/queries/*`** or **`src/hooks/mutations/*`**.
- No new specs under **`src/hooks/queries/`** or **`src/hooks/mutations/`**.
- POs: no assertions; specs use **`screen`** / **`userEvent`**.
